values ('d4a8c2e7-1b59-4f06-9a31-6e0c3b8d5f17', 'introduction-to-kinesiology-exercise-science', 'Introduction to Kinesiology / Exercise Science', 'Designed as a 15-module first-year gateway course. Each module can map to one week in a semester format, with short labs, observation assignments, article discussions, career explorations, and a final integrative analysis of a real movement, health, or performance problem.');

